                                                                                        Na Super Ionic Conductor (NASICON) materials are an important class of solid-
                                        Check for updates                               state electrolytes owing to their high ionic conductivity and superior chemical
                                                                                        and electrochemical stability. In this paper, we combine ﬁrst-principles cal-


