The audit CSV had CRLF line endings and my append normalized part of it, which would make the commit noisy. I’m restoring the file’s CRLF format before committing so the diff stays focused on the five new audit rows.
exec
/bin/zsh -lc "python3 - <<'PY'
from pathlib import Path
p=Path('data/evidence/wishlist-fetch-audit.csv')
text=p.read_text()
p.write_bytes(text.replace('\\r\\n','\\n').replace('\\r','\\n').replace('\\n','\\r\\n').encode())
PY
git diff --numstat -- data/evidence/wishlist-fetch-audit.csv
